  terrain: Shattered skyscrapers, cratered boulevards, burned industrial zones, fractured bridges, rubble fields, underground transit ruins, and fortified ruins.
  vegetation: Sparse weeds, dead trees, and overgrowth.
  buildingsAndProps: 'Military: AA guns, radar, bunkers. Urban: ruined towers, collapsed structures, vehicles, debris. Logistics: trucks, crates, fuel drums, drones.'
  effects: Smoke, dust, fire, sparks, explosions, and falling debris.
  audio: Explosions, rubble impacts, machinery, and radio chatter.
